FileName: everest-2026-09-29.zip/ext-mbedtls/ChangeLog
SPDXID: SPDXRef-item15291830
FileChecksum: SHA1: 4ad15765cc83f08a3fdc4eff3c7bc48d518d275d
FileChecksum: SHA256: 6936859e87f957b4603404f74b8faa72a771f6f35b27117557486893f9cf68f9
FileChecksum: MD5: 82d575ade348ea3cafca60c4126e1a0b
LicenseConcluded: Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later
LicenseInfoInFile: GPL-2.0-or-later
LicenseInfoInFile: Apache-2.0
LicenseInfoInFile: LicenseRef-fossology-Dual-license
FileCopyrightText: <text> copyright of contributors other than Arm is now acknowledged, and the years of publishing are no longer tracked in the source files. This also eliminates the need for the lines declaring the files to be part of MbedTLS. Fixes #3457. Add the command line parameter key_pwd to the s
copyright issues. Features Parsing PEM private keys encrypted with DES and AES are now supported as well (Fixes ticket #5) Added crl_app program to allow easy reading and printing of X509 CRLs from file
© Antón Otero Ferreira Fixed a bug in the CBC code, thanks to dowst; also, the bignum code is no longer dependent on long long Updated rsa_pkcs1_sign to handle arbitrary large inputs Updated timing.c for improved compatibility with i386 and 486 processors, thanks to Ar </text>

